{2000}{}{[ A Super Mutant wearing overalls crudely stitched from brahmin hide looks down at you and gives a slow nod. ]

Alright. Ready for some work?}
{2010}{}{Yes.}
{2020}{}{Not ready yet.}
{3000}{}{[ He kicks a crate piled with ore and minerals towards you.. ]

Here are some resources. You've got one hour to bring me 30 rounds of 5.56 AP. If you're late, you're dead.}
{3010}{}{Clear.}
{3020}{}{Hold up, I have some questions.}
{4000}{}{Work on it.}
{5000}{}{So? You got the ammo?}
{5010}{}{Yes!}
{5020}{}{Not yet.}
{6000}{}{**growls** You're late, so you're dead...}
{7000}{}{Good job. Come back later for more work.}
{8000}{}{Be quick.}
{8010}{}{What do I need to do here?}
{8020}{}{What about tools?}
{9000}{}{[The Super Mutant crosses his arms and sighs. He leans forward and speaks in a flat, monotonous voice. ]

Load the wood into the generators. Fire up the furnaces and smelt the ore. Mill the coal and minerals. Put it all together and make some ammo! Come on, you were sent here because you’re supposed to have brains.}
{9010}{}{That sounds hard!}
{10000}{}{All the tools you need are scattered across this floor.}
{11000}{}{[ A Super Mutant wearing overalls crudely stitched from brahmin hide looks down at you and gives a slow nod. ]

Have I seen your slaves working, shepherd?}
{11010}{}{Yes, what about them?}
{11020}{}{Not yet.}
{12000}{}{Doing well, but they need to complete at least ten rounds before I give you something.}
{12010}{}{Get what?}
{12020}{}{10 rounds done.}
{13000}{}{[ The Super Mutant chuckles and shakes head ]

Curiosity... We have been working on some upgrades to your slaves. Implants, chips, modified collars. If you're into that, of course.}
{13010}{}{Nice.}
{14000}{}{I referred you to the Architect. Talk to him and you get one of special artefacts from him.}

